-- Add token pricing for models hosted on https://www.novapuraai.com
-- that currently return price_unset from GET /api/pricing.
--
-- Conversion: model_ratio = input_usd_per_million / 2
--             (1 ratio = $2 / 1M input tokens)
--             completion_ratio = output_usd / input_usd
--
-- Sources (2026-08-26): DeepSeek official off-peak; Mistral Codestral list;
-- AI21 Jamba Large; Databricks DBRX; Together (Muse Glimmer, Llama Guard 4);
-- OpenRouter Gemma 3; DeepInfra (Mixtral 8x22B, Llama 2 70B, StarCoder2, Nemotron 340B);
-- Nebius Nemotron Ultra 253B; Fireworks size bands; live-site NVIDIA size matches
-- for NIM models with no publisher per-token list.
--
-- Production docker-compose uses PostgreSQL. Run the matching dialect, then
-- restart the API (or wait for option sync) so /api/pricing refreshes.
-- JSON merge keeps existing priced models; it only adds/overwrites these keys.

-- ========== PostgreSQL ==========
